---
title: Garlic Chive Cream Cheese
image: https://www.thelittleepicurean.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/cucumber-crostini.jpg
---

Combine @cream cheese or mascarpone{8%oz}(softened), @garlic powder{1/4%tsp}, @onion powder{1/4%tsp}, @chives{1%tbsp}, and @heavy cream or milk{splash}.

> If using dried chives, use 1 tsp instead.